Package: pannet
Type: Package
Title: Neural Regression Models for Panel Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Imad", family = "El-Badisy", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "elbadisyimad@gmail.com")
Description: Implements neural regression models for panel and longitudinal data. The package provides
    multilayer perceptron architectures with pooled, individual-effect, time-effect, two-way-effect,
    and dynamic panel structures. Supported outcome families include Gaussian, binomial, Poisson,
    multiclass, and fractional outcomes, estimated through panel-aware preprocessing and the local
    mlp package.
